  "content": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2GB3QhtXb4I\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n本模组最初由 SonicJumper 创作（原帖可在<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/1442984-1-6-2-enhanced-visuals-v0-3-deprecated-updated-8\">此处</a>找到）。\n\nEnhancedVisuals 通过在 HUD 上添加效果，提供更具沉浸感的体验。\n\n**Optifine**\n若要与 Optifine 同时使用 EnhancedVisuals，必须关闭快速渲染、各向异性过滤和抗锯齿功能。否则，当某些效果激活时，屏幕会变黑。\n\n**资源包**\nnox_cgt 制作的 Pixelated v1.3 EnhancedVisuals 资源包 <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/9tc2q813jrtoj20/Pixelated_v1.3_EnhancedVisuals%20by%20nox_cgt.zip?dl=1\">下载</a>\n\n**ToughAsNails 和 SimpleDifficulty 的附加组件**\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjOViAN-N4\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n正在寻找与朋友一起游玩的服务器？我们的赞助商为您提供支持：\n\n[<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png \" width=\"250\">\n](https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative)\n\n使用优惠码 teamcreative，即可在任意游戏服务器的首月享受 25% 折扣！\n\n[<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" width=\"250\">](https://www.patreon.com/creativemd)",
